/*@meta

Author:
'Sound Dust'

Description:
'A complex mess of sound'

Usage:
'MW for oddness\r\nAT gear change'

Categories:
'Pads:Atonal, Pads:Breathy, Pads:Distorted, Pads:Drones, Pads:Evolving, Pads:Soundscape'

